{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47947","headline":"遗画工诗 · 释明解","name":"遗画工诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"握手不能别，抚膺聊自伤。\n痛矣时阴短，悲哉泉路长。\n松林惊野吹，荒隧落寒霜。\n言离何以赠，留心内典章。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"释明解","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}